    "body": "A `BufferSource` doesn't have a `length` attribute. Looking at https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#es-buffer-source-types it doesn't look like there is an existing algorithm to get the length of a buffer source so I would move this step to between when we use the \"a copy of the bytes held\" algorithm to create `dataPrefix` and when we set it to an empty sequence if the dictionary member is not present.",
